## Integration acceptance

- Verify available, skipped, installation-in-progress and rejected states using supported native fixtures.
- Confirm opening a maintenance view or dismissing a message cannot be mistaken for a successful repair.
- Check badge counts update without navigation while each repair’s native content and permissions remain intact.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

